og/2026/2026-08-05_AI-comments/2026-08-05_AI-Accusation-comments_61.jpg\"><img src=\"https://www.davidrevoy.com/data/images/blog/2026/2026-08-05_AI-comments/2026-08-05_AI-Accusation-comments_61.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>  </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.davidrevoy.com/data/images/blog/2026/2026-08-05_AI-comments/2026-08-05_AI-Accusation-comments_62.jpg\"><img src=\"https://www.davidrevoy.com/data/images/blog/2026/2026-08-05_AI-comments/2026-08-05_AI-Accusation-comments_62.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n              </div>\n\n        \n        \n      </article>\n\t\t</section>\n    \n    <a title=\"Previous post:Authenticity Problem\" href=\"https://www.davidrevoy.com/article1163/authenticity-problem\">    <img src=\"https://www.davidrevoy.com/themes/blogtheme/ico/prev.svg\" alt=\"\">   </a>\t</main>\n  \n  </div></DIV>","content_text":"Published on 05 august 2026 Here is a collection of screenshots (obfuscated) of dozens and dozens of online comments from many platforms (Reddit, YouTube, Instagram, Facebook) containing accusations or confusion that my artworks and comics are AI-generated. Despite creating every piece by hand, despite sharing timelapses, the comments keep coming, and they're getting stronger. Making this collection was the source of frustration inspiration for my weekly comic episode 64, Authenticity Problem. I hope it gives you a sense of what it feels like and how problematic it is for artists like me in 2026 who are \"prime\" sources for AI image generation training data, with over 20 years of my art online trained without my consent...","fetched_at":"2026-08-08T00:21:31.766Z","ok":true,"blocks":[{"html_en":"<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPublished on <time datetime=\"2026-08-05\">05 august 2026</time> \n\t\t\t\t\t</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Published on 05 august 2026","zh":"发布于 2026 年 8 月 5 日"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Here is a collection of screenshots (obfuscated) of dozens and dozens of online comments from many platforms (Reddit, YouTube, Instagram, Facebook) containing accusations or confusion that my artworks and comics are AI-generated. Despite creating every piece by hand, despite sharing timelapses, the comments keep coming, and they're getting stronger. </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Here is a collection of screenshots (obfuscated) of dozens and dozens of online comments from many platforms (Reddit, YouTube, Instagram, Facebook) containing accusations or confusion that my artworks and comics are AI-generated.","zh":"这是来自许多平台（Reddit、YouTube、Instagram、Facebook）的数十条在线评论的屏幕截图（经过模糊处理），其中包含对我的艺术作品和漫画是人工智能生成的指控或困惑。"},{"en":"Despite creating every piece by hand, despite sharing timelapses, the comments keep coming, and they're getting stronger.","zh":"尽管每件作品都是手工创作的，尽管分享了延时摄影，但评论仍然源源不断，而且越来越强烈。"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Making this collection was the source of <del>frustration</del> inspiration for my weekly comic episode 64, <a href=\"https://www.peppercarrot.com/en/miniFantasyTheater/064.html\">Authenticity Problem</a>.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Making this collection was the source of frustration inspiration for my weekly comic episode 64, Authenticity Problem.","zh":"制作这个系列是我每周漫画第 64 集“真实性问题”的挫折灵感的来源。"}]},{"html_en":"<p>I hope it gives you a sense of what it feels like and how problematic it is for artists like me in 2026 who are \"prime\" sources for AI image generation training data, with over 20 years of my art online trained without my consent...</p>","sentences":[{"en":"I hope it gives you a sense of what it feels like and how problematic it is for artists like me in 2026 who are \"prime\" sources for AI image generation training data, with over 20 years of my art online trained without my consent...","zh":"我希望它能让你了解这种感觉，以及对于 2026 年像我这样的艺术家来说，这是多么有问题，他们是人工智能图像生成训练数据的“主要”来源，我的艺术作品在未经我同意的情况下进行了 20 多年的在线训练......"}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n\t<main role=\"main\">\n        <p><a title=\"Previous post:Authenticity Problem\" href=\"https://www.davidrevoy.com/article1163/authenticity-problem\">    <img src=\"https://www.davidrevoy.com/themes/blogtheme/ico/prev.svg\" alt=\"\">   </a>        </p>\n    \n\t\t<section class=\"page\">\n\t\t\t<article role=\"article\" id=\"post-1164\">\n\t\t\t\t<header>\n            \n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>发布于 2026 年 8 月 5 日</p>\n\t\t\t\t</header>\n          \n          <!-- Content -->\n          <div>\n                \n                <p>这是来自许多平台（Reddit、YouTube、Instagram、Facebook）的数十条在线评论的屏幕截图（经过模糊处理），其中包含对我的艺术作品和漫画是人工智能生成的指控或困惑。 尽管每件作品都是手工创作的，尽管分享了延时摄影，但评论仍然源源不断，而且越来越强烈。</p>\n<p>制作这个系列是我每周漫画第 64 集“真实性问题”的挫折灵感的来源。</p>\n<p>我希望它能让你了解这种感觉，以及对于 2026 年像我这样的艺术家来说，这是多么有问题，他们是人工智能图像生成训练数据的“主要”来源，我的艺术作品在未经我同意的情况下进行了 20 多年的在线训练......</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.davidrevoy.com/data/images/blog/2026/2026-08-05_AI-comments/2026-08-05_AI-Accusation-comments_01.jpg\"><img src=\"https://www.davidrevoy.com/data/images/blog/2026/2026-08-05_AI-comments/2026-08-05_AI-Accusation-comments_01.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>  </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.davidrevoy.com/data/images/blog/2026/2026-08-05_AI-comments/2026-08-05_AI-Accusation-comments_02.jpg\"><img src=\"https://www.davidrevoy.com/data/images/blog/2026/2026-08-05_AI-comments/2026-08-05_AI-Accusation-comments_02.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>  </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.davidrevoy.com/data/images/blog/2026/2026-08-05_AI-comments/2026-08-05_AI-Accusation-comments_03.jpg\"><img src=\"https://www.davidrevoy.com/data/images/blog/2026/2026-08-05_AI-comments/2026-08-05_AI-Accusation-comments_03.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>  </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.davidrevoy.com/data/images/blog/2026/2026-08-05_AI-comments/2026-08-05_AI-Accusation-comments_04.jpg\"><img src=\"https://www.davidrevoy.com/data/images/blog/2026/2026-08-05_AI-comments/2026-08-05_AI-Accusation-comments_04.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>  </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.davidrevoy.com/data/images/blog/2026/2026-08-05_AI-comments/2026-08-05_AI-Accusation-comments_05.jpg\"><img src=\"https://www.davidrevoy.com/data/images/blog/2026/2026-08-05_AI-comment